# Settings is Arc's window (Arc 1.172.2, measured 11 and 12 Nov 2026, GitHub #372): fixed at 684 × 650 pt, a toolbar
# of tabs in Arc's order, and it opens on the first tab every time it is opened, not on the one used last. Cra's
# sidebar list of eleven panes (Dia's window) is gone; the old pane names, which scenarios and the command bar's
# "Search Settings…" use, open the tab that holds them now.
budget rss=600 stalls50=10
seed settings.json {"hasSeenImportPrompt": true, "toolbarDefaultMigrated": true}
cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=kept
expect-log loaded 127\.0\.0\.1 \(HTTP 200\)
wait 1
cra://action/settings
wait 1
cra://debug?windowState=first
expect-log window state first: settings visible=1 front=1 tab=sync size=684x650 resizable=0
cra://debug?settingsPane=profiles
wait 1
cra://debug?windowState=profiles
expect-log window state profiles: settings visible=1 front=1 tab=profiles size=684x650 resizable=0
# Tabs, Plugins and Performance are no tabs of their own now.
cra://debug?settingsPane=tabs
wait 1
cra://debug?windowState=tabs
expect-log window state tabs: settings visible=1 front=1 tab=general size=684x650
cra://debug?settingsPane=plugins
wait 1
cra://debug?windowState=plugins
expect-log window state plugins: settings visible=1 front=1 tab=extensions size=684x650
cra://debug?settingsPane=performance
wait 1
cra://debug?windowState=performance
expect-log window state performance: settings visible=1 front=1 tab=advanced size=684x650
# A name that is no tab leaves the tab where it is.
cra://debug?settingsPane=nonsense
wait 1
cra://debug?windowState=nonsense
expect-log window state nonsense: settings visible=1 front=1 tab=advanced size=684x650
# Closed and opened again: the first tab, as Arc's.
cra://action/closeTab
wait 1
cra://debug?windowState=closed
expect-log window state closed: settings visible=0
cra://action/settings
wait 1
cra://debug?windowState=reopened
expect-log window state reopened: settings visible=1 front=1 tab=sync size=684x650
